    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπάλῐμος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[πᾰ]</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάλπη</span> A) 
			Ep.
		
		Adj.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>swift</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					16.342
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				809
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.280
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				957
			</span></i> (lyr.): more freq. in Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-μως</span>
			<i>swiftly</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				1.359
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>eager, ravenous</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένυες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					12.20
				</span></i>
			.</div>
